<title>JAPAN: Akebono sets terms on 400 mln yen warrant.</title>
<headline>Akebono sets terms on 400 mln yen warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER Akebono Brake Industry Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	     ISSUE NO  1	   AMT   400 million yen</p>
<p> COUPON 2.05%	     ISS PRICE 104 yen   MATURITY 15.Dec.00</p>
<p>EXERCISE PRICE 616 yen</p>
<p>EXERCISE FRM 03.Feb.97 EXERCISE TO 14.Dec.00</p>
